OL,3,GNEWSAFamily pays tribute to 'loving'
OL,4,Adad as son charged with murder
OL,5,
OL,6,FTributes have been paid to a "loving
OL,7,Ffather with a big heart" who was found
OL,8,Fdead inside a flat.
OL,10,FNorth Wales Police were called to Llys
OL,11,FWatling, London Road, Holyhead, on
OL,12,FAnglesey, at around 02:40 BST on
OL,13,FSaturday, where the body of Michael
OL,14,FWard was discovered.
OL,16,FMartin Ward, 33, from Holyhead,
OL,17,Fappeared at Llandudno Magistrates'
OL,18,FCourt on Monday charged with murdering
OL,19,Fhis 53-year-old father.
OL,21,FMartin Ward will appear at Caernarfon
OL,22,FCrown Court on Wednesday.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
